{
  "date": "2025-05-01",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "냉면에 갈비먹은 하연이 등장",
      "en": "HaYeon who just ate naengmyeon and galbi has arrived."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 배불러",
      "en": "I'm so full."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "원래 물냉 좋아하는데",
      "en": "I usually like mul-naengmyeon,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘은 뭔가 비냉땡겨서",
      "en": "but for some reason I was craving bibim-naengmyeon today,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "머금",
      "en": "so I ate that."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞다 어제 티저 떴잖아",
      "en": "Oh right, the teaser came out yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기대되지 막",
      "en": "You're getting excited, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ 연기 잘했어?",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ Did I act well?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "빨리 본뮤비도 봤으면 좋겠다",
      "en": "I can't wait for you to see the full music video too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "더 좋아할텐데",
      "en": "I think you'll like it even more."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "수록곡 내파트들도",
      "en": "My parts in the B-sides"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋아",
      "en": "are good too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "커플링곡도",
      "en": "The coupling tracks too,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나랑",
      "en": "they"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘어울리는듯",
      "en": "really suit me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사실 어울린다긴보다",
      "en": "Actually, rather than saying they suit me,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 잘하는 느낌~~",
      "en": "they're just the kind of thing I'm good at~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기대를 증폭 시키고 싶어서",
      "en": "I just wanted to build up your expectations."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "해본 말이구여",
      "en": "That's why I said it."
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 연기과야…",
      "en": "I'm in the acting department..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그렇게 신뢰하진 않았었구나~?",
      "en": "So you didn't have that much faith in me~?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅇㄹㅌㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹ",
      "en": "ㅇㄹㅌㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뮤비찍을때 감독님이 표정연기를 제일 잘하는거같다고",
      "en": "While filming the music video, the director said I was the best at acting with my facial expressions."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "해주셔떠 ㅎㅎ",
      "en": "That's what he told me. ㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "자랑하고싶었음",
      "en": "I just wanted to brag a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 곧 쇼케다",
      "en": "The showcase is really just around the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "빨리 뮤비 보고싶어 ㅠㅠ",
      "en": "I can't wait to see the music video. ㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "푹 자고있을테니까 12일에 깨워주세요",
      "en": "I'm going to sleep until then, so wake me up on the 12th."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜",
      "en": "Seriously,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "1년만에 컴백이다..",
      "en": "it's our first comeback in a year..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "1년은 나의 준비기간이였던거지",
      "en": "That whole year was my time to prepare."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "활동 재밌게 하쟈",
      "en": "Let's have lots of fun during promotions."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘 멤버들이 나한테 와서",
      "en": "Lately the members have been coming up to me"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "많이 늘었다고",
      "en": "telling me that I've improved a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "해줘서",
      "en": "Hearing that"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "뭔가",
      "en": "makes me feel like"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "해낸것같은 느낌",
      "en": "I've really accomplished something."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좋아",
      "en": "I like that."
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "니 지금",
      "en": "Right now,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "배가 너무불러서",
      "en": "my stomach is so full"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아파",
      "en": "it hurts."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좀 움직일게",
      "en": "I'm going to move around a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 많이 먹었나봐 ㅋㅅㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋ",
      "en": "I guess I ate too much. ㅋㅅㅋㅋㄹㄹㅋㄹㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "큰일났ㄴ넹",
      "en": "I'm in trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 배불러서",
      "en": "I'm so full,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그렇게 많이 먹었나",
      "en": "did I really eat that much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "갈비 7조각",
      "en": "Seven pieces of galbi,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "냉면 4분의3 먹음",
      "en": "and about three-quarters of a bowl of naengmyeon."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 그니까",
      "en": "I mean,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "생각보다 막 먹지",
      "en": "it's not like I ate"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "않았는데",
      "en": "that much."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "왤케",
      "en": "So why am I"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "급하게 먹었네",
      "en": "this full already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "요즘 다이어트 너무 빡시게 해서 소식가 된거 아냐?!? ㅜㅜ 어뜩해 ㅜㅜㅜ",
      "en": "Have you been dieting so hard lately that you've become a light eater?!? ㅜㅜ What are we going to do? ㅜㅜㅜ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "요즘좀 다이어트 내려놓긴 했는데 ㅎㅎ",
      "en": "I've actually eased up on dieting lately though. ㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 나",
      "en": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좀",
      "en": "I kind of"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "찜!!!!",
      "en": "gained a little!!!!"
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "컴백전인데",
      "en": "Right before the comeback too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "저번에",
      "en": "The other day,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "유빈언니가",
      "en": "YuBin unnie"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "밤인데",
      "en": "said,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "또 밥먹자는겨",
      "en": "\"It's nighttime, but let's go eat again.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가",
      "en": "So I said,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아냐 나 진짜 살쪄서",
      "en": "\"No, I've seriously gained weight,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안돼",
      "en": "I can't.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "언닌 안찌잖아!!!!",
      "en": "\"You never gain weight!!!!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이랬는데",
      "en": "That's what I told her."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아냐 나도 쪘어~}",
      "en": "\"No, I gained some too~}\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러는거애",
      "en": "That's what she said."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서",
      "en": "So I went,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "에 진짜?",
      "en": "\"Huh? Really?\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이랬더니",
      "en": "Then she said,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 ㅎ..사실 좀 빠짐",
      "en": "\"Actually... ㅎ I've lost a little.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "이러는거야",
      "en": "Can you believe that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "와",
      "en": "Wow."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "배신감",
      "en": "I felt so betrayed."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서",
      "en": "So..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 요즘 근육이 많이 붙어서",
      "en": "I've been putting on a lot of muscle lately,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그냥 눈바디만 보려고",
      "en": "so I've just been judging by how my body looks in the mirror,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "몸무게를",
      "en": "instead of"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "안재고있단 말이야",
      "en": "checking my weight."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러고 나서 유진언니랑",
      "en": "Then later, YuJin unnie and I"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 몸무게를 재봤는데",
      "en": "weighed ourselves,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 놀라가지고",
      "en": "and I was so shocked"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "유빈",
      "en": "that YuBin..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 충격먹고",
      "en": "caught me"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "멈춰있는걸",
      "en": "just standing there in shock,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "언니가 찍음",
      "en": "and she took a picture of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 짜증나!!!!!!",
      "en": "I was so annoyed!!!!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하ㅏㅏ",
      "en": "Haaa..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞아",
      "en": "Seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "마른사람의",
      "en": "The audacity"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "기만",
      "en": "of naturally skinny people."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "!!!!!",
      "en": "!!!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "박시온:???",
      "en": "Park ShiOn: ???"
    },
        {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ 시온언니 지금 내앞에서 치킨이랑 아이스크림 먹고있음",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋ ShiOn unnie is eating chicken and ice cream right in front of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 배불러서 치킨의 향이",
      "en": "I'm so full that even the smell of the chicken"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "토할거같음 더 배불러져 막",
      "en": "is making me feel like I'm going to throw up. It's making me feel even fuller."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "미치겠당",
      "en": "I'm going crazy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "근데 못참고 딸기를 먹어버림",
      "en": "But I couldn't resist and ended up eating some strawberries."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "딸기 배는 따로 있는거같아..",
      "en": "I think there's a separate stomach just for strawberries..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘들어가네",
      "en": "They went down so easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "응..",
      "en": "Yep..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "과일은 배채우는게 아니라 음미하는거야…",
      "en": "Fruit isn't for filling your stomach. It's for savoring..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞아 지금 음미중",
      "en": "Exactly. I'm savoring them right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 오늘",
      "en": "Seriously, today..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "비가 왤케",
      "en": "why is it"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "많이 와",
      "en": "raining so much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아까 비오는거 모르고 나갔다가",
      "en": "Earlier I went outside without realizing it was raining,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞으면서 다님",
      "en": "so I ended up walking around getting soaked."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "청춘이지 그칰ㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "That's youth for you. ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 운동해야겠어",
      "en": "I should go work out."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "뭐야 갑자기 큰 결심을 하고 왓네",
      "en": "Whoa, where did that sudden determination come from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그치 큰결심 했어",
      "en": "Right? I made a big decision."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㄹ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "오늘 행복하게 보내구~~!",
      "en": "Have a happy day today~~!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 이만 가보께~~",
      "en": "I'm going to head out now~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하랑해🥰🤭",
      "en": "Haranghae. 🥰🤭"
    }
  ]
}